<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-cornus-controversa-turing-wavelength-s0-source-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cornus controversa Turing wavenumber at 1.939 mm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Source and data traceability: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Eight DOIs were checked against Crossref on 2026-10-27, including Turing 1952, Schnakenberg 1979, and Xiang et al. 2006. The specimen SHA-256 be3da2bb8b817bec105efa4dec6064d234f1c47ab458bdf8059d885529dccff4 matches the species-gallery file and is pinned in the reference JSON. License recorded as public domain (Meise / Wikimedia). Deduction: slot 3155 is absent from campaign_100_slots.yaml, so the scout CLI could not be pointed at --slot 3155; OpenAlex lexical search did not return the seed papers, which were resolved on Crossref instead." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
